  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Change the Future for A Child with Scoliosis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2022 a young beneficiary of our organization was diagnosed with Marfan Syndrome, requiring extended therapeutic intervention to give him the best outlook for his future.  We need your help in covering the cost of therapies, devices and equipment required over the coming years.   While we can&apos;t be sure of the exact costs our initial target of $3500 is to cover a year of his medical insurance costs. Join us as we walk this journey in helping Alex face this challenge life has presented.</narrative>
  </description>
